---
Scene data in app/public/scene/ (inner.sog, outer.sog, terrain.bin and derived files) is derived from
"Muddy Excavator Site" by dok11 (https://superspl.at/scene/ded12920), licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), itself reconstructed from footage by David Pickup on Pexels.
Changes: levelled, metrically scaled, cropped, cleaned of sub-surface splats, split and re-encoded.
